{"script":"sub_0_08_1","des":"委托板","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":true,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]啊，我在把一些附近住民发布的契约贴在旁边的委托板上。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]因为基本上都是些什么去哪里清理些什么的任务，[r][l]无论是你们还是我们都见得太多了，自然手续也不需要那么麻烦啦。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":771,"y":573,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"emoticon04"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"fore","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":771,"y":573,"transTime":0,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"emoticon04"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":771,"y":573,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"emoticon04"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]哦～？你们就需要这个？那可太好了～[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":771,"y":573,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"emoticon04"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]如果你们想帮忙，[l]就从看板上取下想要的委托，然后去完成它吧。[r][l]委托完成后，驿站也会颁发一枚对应的代币。[l]积攒足够数量的代币就可以在驿站换取报酬。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]不过要注意，[l]每人每天能接取的委托数量是[color=ff0000]有限制的[colorEnd]，不要想着全拿走喔。[r][l]而且我[color=ff0000]每天都会更新[colorEnd]委托板上的内容。[l]各位[color=ff0000]当天没能完成的任务，我会分给其他契约者[colorEnd]。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]如果感兴趣的话，现在就去看看委托板如何？[r][l]选几个喜欢的任务，和驿站互帮互助吧～？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":433,"y":-218,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara004_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}